This repository contains a new Home Assistant integration and a new reader
for DWD RV ODIM HDF5 data. It does not include source files from the
ha-dwd-precipitation integration or the previous Pergola Box radar module.
The reader follows the DWD and EUMETNET format specifications listed in
ARCHITECTURE.md. h5py and pyproj are external dependencies, installed
separately under their respective licenses. They are not bundled here.
